# Testing

## Context

Tests are colocated `*.test.ts` files run with vitest.

## Rule

- Put new tests next to the file they test, named `<file>.test.ts`.
- Use vitest (`describe`/`it`/`expect`) and an Arrange-Act-Assert structure.
- Add a test for every new action/reducer case/selector.

## How to verify

1. `cd app && npm test` is green.
2. New test files sit beside their source file with matching names.
